          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak king’at Jehovah malaikaiyat; ak kiger rotwennyi eng’ choget. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.21.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.21.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 21:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kingogeer anyun Daudi eng’ sainato kole kagowolji Jehovah inendet eng’ ruanyut ne kiborse ne bo Ornan Jebusindet, koeny kagochinoikyik eng’ yoto. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.21.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.21.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 21:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amu kimi eng’ betusiechoto gotab Jehovah ne kiteechei Musa eng’ ong’atet, komosta ne toror eng’ Gibeon, koboto kaptisisietab kagochinet ne kibeelei. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.21.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.21.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 21:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ago kima imuch Daudi kwo taitab kaptisisionoto kwo koteepse Kamuktaindet: amu kiiyweisiei amu rotwetab chok ne bo malaikaiyatab Jehovah.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.21.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.21.30"
            ]
          }
        }
